	%	We know need to show that the $\forall$Exp+Cutting Planes refutation of $\alpha$ is also valid as a $\forall$Exp+Cutting Planes refutation of $\exists \Xvec \in \D:\{ \Phi_1 \dots \Phi_n\}$. Consider an axiom step, a complete assignment $\beta$ to the universal variables in some subgame of $\alpha$  is used, and an inequality is chosen from the subgame.
