achieving additional efficiency gains with minimal degradation in quality. See Fig.~\ref{fig:introduction} for the results, demonstrating that our RALU preserves structural fidelity and texture details with significantly fewer artifacts even under aggressive acceleration over temporal acceleration method (\textit{e.g.}, ToCa~\cite{zou2024accelerating}) and spatial acceleration method (\textit{e.g.}, Bottleneck Sampling~\cite{tian2025training}).

