%The Hessian of the  surrogate model $\hat{J}^{(i)}$ remains bounded within the \ac{tr}, i.e., \begin{align*}
%\Vert H_{\hat{J}^{(i)}}(\mu)\Vert \leq \kappa_{umh} \quad \forall \mu \in B_{std}^{(i)}
