In a practical implementation, we propose the following termination criteria for the optimization subproblem when iterating over $l$ for a fixed $i$:
\begin{align}
\label{termination_subproblem}
\left\Vert\nabla \hat{J}^{(i)}(\mu^{(i,l)}) \right\Vert_\infty \leq \tau_{\textnormal{sub}} \quad \textnormal{ or }  \quad \beta_2 \delta^{(i)} \leq \frac{\eta^{(i)}(\mu^{(i,l)})}{\hat{J}^{(i)}(\mu^{(i,l)})} \leq \delta^{(i)}.
\end{align}
%\textnormal{ or } \quad \hat{J}^{(i,l)}_{diff} \leq \tau_J,
