Singular Insert (ms)  & 2067   & 2026   & 2025    \\
% \midrule
% Packed Avg ($\mu$s)    & 6440    & 6320    & 34970    \\
% Singular Avg ($\mu$s)  & 20670   & 20260   & 20250    \\
\midrule
