    \caption{The high-dimensional manifolds are meshed in their native embedding space using the parameterization. The resulting meshes are down-projected to 3D for visualization. Triangle edges are shown in yellow. Triangle color indicates mesh sidedness to aid interpretation of the self-intersection artifacts resulting from the down-projection. The numerically computed point set is shown in black.}
